{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、明日は乃木ののだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈と蘭世との\nちょいサンエト回だよーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送での放送はお休みなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ福島10月29日土曜日23時\n信越放送10月29日土曜日21時\n山梨放送10月29日土曜日18時\n北海道放送10月30日日曜日18時半\n青森放送10月30日日曜日21時半\n秋田放送10月30日日曜日21時\n山形放送10月30日日曜日22時\n長崎放送10月30日日曜日24時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のどれかで聴いてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方歓喜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酒井さん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストはなんと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晋平太さん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストコーナーの前の\nフリースタイルのコーナーから\n出演してくださいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「一生ラップできる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痺れました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の回転の早さって\nとても魅力的だなと思いました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はもちろん、みんな興奮してたね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後、酒井さん\n個人的に誕生日ラップやってもらってたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジで神回でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてくれてありがとうね！\n観覧も雨の中来てくれてありがとう ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張で個別です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、知った雑学を教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/29/9745248/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、観たオヌヌメの動画は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\nここ最近握手会ありすぎてネタがないとき\n答えを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}